# Sending Photo Using Image URL   [Skip link to Sending Photo Using Image URL](https://telegram-bot-sdk.readme.io/reference/sendphoto#sending-photo-using-image-url)
## Example   [Skip link to Example](https://telegram-bot-sdk.readme.io/reference/sendphoto#example)
```php
use Telegram\Bot\Api;

$telegram = new Api('BOT TOKEN');

$response = $telegram->sendPhoto([\
	'chat_id' => 'CHAT_ID',\
	'photo' => 'http://example.com/photos/image.jpg',\
	'caption' => 'Some caption'\
]);

$messageId = $response->getMessageId();
```

